WEBVTT

00:16:59.704 --> 00:17:03.204
then I hope I'm going to stay more humble,
more curious mindset.

00:17:04.329 --> 00:17:07.746
That's great. When I was reading, I think,
again, it was occurring to me,

00:17:07.746 --> 00:17:10.621
you know, that you tell
such great stories,

00:17:10.621 --> 00:17:14.954
including like the story of the BlackBerry
company and, you know,

00:17:15.704 --> 00:17:19.996
Mike's inability to rethink the
way perhaps he could have

00:17:19.996 --> 00:17:24.704
and what might have been. And I, too,
was a huge fan of that keyboard.

00:17:26.121 --> 00:17:31.871
The question I had is, how do you find
partnerships where there is a thinker